; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - year-by-year result M30, setup 2 of 10: sell, session AllDay server time, trend filter H1 EMA 200; entries only when the Stochastic (7,1,7) of the trigger timeframe came from 80 (sells) / 20 (buys) within 5 bars and turned (UseStochTurnFilter). DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Picked for the year ahead on 2024 - 13 Nov 2026 by the year-by-year rule: lowest of six profit factors 1.53; 2024: 27 trades PF 2.45, 2025: 27 trades PF 1.67, 2026: 22 trades PF 1.53. These are calibration figures.
; Year by year, setups picked by this rule on the three years before each year: 2023 PF 1.22 (65 trades), 2024 PF 1.39 (170 trades), 2025 PF 1.87 (251 trades), 2026 PF 1.26 (267 trades); all 4 unseen years together PF 1.46 (753 trades, stressed 1.41). The last year (2026) was kept back and checked once.
; ScaleWithPrice: the *_Points distances were calibrated at 72408.79 (ReferencePrice) and follow the price.
; RiskPercent 0.1: the 10 presets are meant to run together on one hedging account, and they overlap.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer). Demo and Strategy Tester first.
; UseNewsFilter was not in the backtest.
